WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:46.446
The third Open Source Orchestra DAO meetup is presented as an open invitation for everyone: musicians, builders, listeners, translators, and curious guests. Its date, time, place and public meeting details are still to be announced in this hall. Attending it would not enrol anyone in a DAO, and no wallet would be required to listen or take part in the community conversation. Meanwhile the join process is already public. A rotating circle of at least three stewards is described as the review path, with a personal answer intended within fourteen days. If you consent to a public artist card, it is drafted from the material you submit and shown to you first. You approve it, change it, or decline it; nothing should go live without your yes. Open jams remain open without that application.
